Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:27:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] chore: add Dockerfile that builds and runs the hosannaith-mcp
 server

Glama's "Runs from source" indexing requires a Dockerfile it can build and run
to perform automated safety/quality checks on the MCP server. Multi-stage build:
compile mcp/ TypeScript to dist/, then a slim runtime image with production
dependencies only, entrypoint `node dist/index.js` (stdio MCP server). AVM_MNEMONIC
is supplied at runtime and is only needed for the paid tools, so initialization and
tool-listing checks succeed without it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SazAweXpNUp8EDw2G9eBqH
---
 Dockerfile | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Dockerfile

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..0aeefa3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+# Builds and runs the hosannaith-mcp Model Context Protocol server (source in mcp/).
+# The server communicates over stdio — this is how an MCP client, and Glama's automated
+# safety/quality checks, talk to it.
+#
+#   docker build -t hosannaith-mcp .
+#   docker run --rm -i -e AVM_MNEMONIC="<25-word Algorand mnemonic>" hosannaith-mcp
+#
+# AVM_MNEMONIC is only needed to invoke the paid tools; the server starts and lists its
+# tools without it, so initialization/tool-listing checks pass with no secret present.
+
+# ---- build stage: compile mcp/ TypeScript to dist/ ----
+FROM node:22-slim AS build
+WORKDIR /app
+COPY mcp/package.json mcp/tsconfig.json ./
+RUN npm install --no-audit --no-fund
+COPY mcp/src ./src
+RUN npm run build
+
+# ---- runtime stage: production dependencies + compiled output ----
+FROM node:22-slim
+WORKDIR /app
+ENV NODE_ENV=production
+COPY mcp/package.json ./
+RUN npm install --omit=dev --no-audit --no-fund
+COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist
+COPY mcp/README.md ./README.md
+
+# stdio MCP server
+ENTRYPOINT ["node", "dist/index.js"]
